{
  "name": "Florence MCP — SellerApp",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Florence MCP — SellerApp\n\n17 SellerApp endpoints exposed as MCP tools for Florence (Cowork) to call directly from chat.\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Replace `support_keplo` and `fbfa59f5-43fb-460e-ac0b-4740132a81f1` in every HTTP Request Tool node's headers section. Get values from your SellerApp dashboard → API settings.\n2. Activate the workflow (top-right toggle).\n3. Copy the MCP Server Trigger's Production URL (ends in `/sse`).\n4. In your terminal: `claude mcp add --transport sse florence-sellerapp '<URL>'`.\n5. Restart Claude Code or Cowork to load.\n\n**Auth**: hardcoded `client-id` + `token` headers per tool. Workshop-shared credentials get distributed out-of-band; never commit to git.\n\n**SellerApp IP allowlist**: the API account must allow n8n.cloud's egress IPs. Check your SellerApp dashboard if calls return 403 host_not_allowed.",
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0a000030-0000-0000-0000-fffffffffffe",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "none",
        "path": "florence-sellerapp"
      },
      "id": "0a000030-0000-0000-0000-ffffffffffff",
      "name": "MCP Server — Florence SellerApp",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        100,
        400
      ],
      "webhookId": "florence-sellerapp-mcp"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "toolDescription": "Get Amazon product details for one or more ASINs. Returns title, brand, BSR, price, ratings, sales estimate, fees, promotions. Use fee_detail/price_detail/potential_detail/ratings/realtime_data/promotions = \"1\" for full audit. Token cost: 1 base + 1-4 per flag.",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.sellerapp.com/sellmetricsv2/products",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "keypair",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "client-id",
              "value": "support_keplo"
            },
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "fbfa59f5-43fb-460e-ac0b-4740132a81f1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "specifyQuery": "keypair",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "productIds",
              "value": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('asin', 'Amazon ASIN(s). Single or comma-delimited (max 20).') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "geo",
              "value": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('geo', 'Lowercase geo: us, uk, de, fr, it, es, ca, mx, br, au, jp, in, ae, sg.') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "fee_detail",
              "value": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('fee_detail', '1 for fee attributes, blank otherwise') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "price_detail",
              "value": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('price_detail', '1 for price attributes') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "potential_detail",
              "value": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('potential_detail', '1 for sales/revenue estimates') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "ratings",
              "value": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('ratings', '1 for ratings') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "realtime_data",
